{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design", "label": "M4 Sandbox Design", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_submilestones", "label": "M4 split into M4a / M4b / M4c", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The library lands first because fault parameters that want to be data (prop imbalance, pole pairs) then land once in the part files; faults precede logging so the logging tests can assert fault transients from real sessions."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_component_library", "label": "M4a component library (library/ part files, schema 5)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_fault_catalog", "label": "M4b v1 fault catalog (seven faults, seams, events)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every fault: a python dataclass in ofs.faults -> proto message in the Fault oneof -> Fault enum variant in vehicle.rs -> fault.* bus signals -> read by its model; crash damage stays out (the script composes it from collision events)."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_ofs_log", "label": "ofs-log MCAP Recorder (byte-identical files)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Recorder is a scheduler model that only reads the bus, so recording never changes a run; metadata is pinned (no wall-clock) so two lockstep runs produce byte-identical MCAP files."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_rerun", "label": "Rerun live view (Python-side, ofs[rerun])", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "4, decision 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rerun's Rust SDK inside ofs-sim is a very large dependency to carry in the server for a viewer's sake; MCAP files open in Foxglove unchanged."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_play_inputs", "label": "play_inputs CSV sample-and-hold scripting", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "5, decision 6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Server-side, tick-quantized sample-and-hold keeps lockstep ordering deterministic; client-side replay would be a gRPC round-trip per change; SetSticks during playback is InvalidArgument (loud beats silently-lost)."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_packaging", "label": "PyPI packaging (open-fpv-sim, import ofs)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "6, decision 5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'ofs' is taken on PyPI by an unrelated object-storage library (verified 2026-10-11); the publish job runs only on tag push so nothing publishes early."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_protocols", "label": "Protocols 8 and 9 (Fault oneof; recording/inputs RPCs)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_faults_bus_signals", "label": "Faults as runtime bus signals, never config", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "decision 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The M2 RadioLinkLoss pattern generalized: rebuild-the-vehicle faults are slow and un-injectable mid-flight; per-model flag APIs need N bespoke seams; injecting and clearing raise events."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_mandatory_provenance", "label": "Provenance mandatory per parameter", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "decision 2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The number's origin is part of the data; advisory provenance would lose the milestone's point."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_hard_cutover", "label": "Parts by reference only, hard cutover at schema 5", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "decision 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dual format doubles every loader path forever; pre-v1 there are no external users to break."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_fault_rng", "label": "Fault state never perturbs a run's randomness", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "decision 7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every added RNG draw happens in a fixed per-step/per-packet position regardless of fault state and its result is used only when the fault is active, so a fault-inactive run is bit-identical to a no-fault run."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_weak_cell_additive", "label": "Weak cell additive on the pack Thevenin model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "decision 9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A per-cell Thevenin refactor would change numerics for every run to model one fault; capacity fade is honestly recorded as out of scope instead."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_10_m3e_video_extras_design", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "header (predecessor, written against its pinned plan)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_04_open_fpv_sim_design", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "header (parent spec 6, 9)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_submilestones", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_component_library", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "1 (M4a row)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_submilestones", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_fault_catalog", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "1 (M4b row)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_submilestones", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_ofs_log", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "1 (M4c row)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_component_library", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_hard_cutover", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "2.3 (parts by reference only, schema 5)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_component_library", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_mandatory_provenance", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "2.2 (every parameter appears in [provenance] or validation error)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_fault_catalog", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_faults_bus_signals", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "3 (faults as runtime bus signals)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_fault_catalog", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_weak_cell_additive", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "3 (WeakCell row, decision 9)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_fault_catalog", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_protocols", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "7 (M4b -> protocol 8)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_ofs_log", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_protocols", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "7 (M4c -> protocol 9)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_fault_catalog", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_08_m3a_osd_vtx_design", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "10 (closes m3a 'VTX faults' debt)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_fault_catalog", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_09_m3b_video_link_design", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "10 (closes m3b 'VTX interference fault' debt)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_rerun", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_ofs_log", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "4 (MCAP is the durable artefact, Rerun the live view over the state stream)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_play_inputs", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_protocols", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md", "source_location": "5/7 (PlayInputs/StopInputs RPCs, inputs events)", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "m4_fault_injection_pipeline", "label": "M4 fault injection pipeline (python dataclass -> proto oneof -> vehicle enum -> fault.* bus signals -> model seams)", "nodes": ["docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_11_m4b_fault_catalog_python_faults", "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_11_m4b_fault_catalog_protocol_8", "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_11_m4b_fault_catalog_fault_enum", "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_11_m4b_fault_catalog_fault_seams", "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_11_m4_sandbox_design_fault_catalog"], "relation": "form", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-m4-sandbox-design.md"}]}